Scope: ddr_frame_store clk_ddr telemetry liveness; cold reset, one doorbell, 70-frame control sweep (longer than the 2^18-cycle mailbox heartbeat) then an identical sweep with DDR read responses withheld. Counts real DDRAM_WE writes to the five mailbox qwords.
Audit: this measures publication liveness only. It does not check mailbox payload correctness, does not model DDR controller behaviour beyond the handshake, and cannot distinguish a stalled DDR controller from a stopped clk_ddr on real hardware — it shows only that the two are indistinguishable through this instrument.
